              "type": "fill_in",
              "answer": "$f'(0)$",
              "question": "若 $f(x)$ 在 $x=0$ 处可导，且 $f(0)=0$，则 $\\lim_{x\\to 0}\\frac{f(x)}{x}=\\underline{\\qquad}$。",
              "solution": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "解析：$\\lim_{x\\to 0}\\frac{f(x)}{x}=\\lim_{x\\to 0}\\frac{f(x)-f(0)}{x-0}=f'(0)$。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": 2,
              "type": "fill_in",
              "answer": "$0$",
              "question": "设 $f(x)=\\ln\\sqrt{1+x^2}$，则 $f'(0)=\\underline{\\qquad}$。",
              "solution": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "解析：$\\because  f(x)=\\ln\\sqrt{1+x^2}=\\frac{1}{2}\\ln(1+x^2)$"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "$\\therefore  f'(x)=\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{1+x^2}\\cdot (1+x^2)'=\\frac{x}{1+x^2}$"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "$\\therefore  f'(0)=0$"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": 3,
              "type": "fill_in",
              "answer": "$(1,0)$",
              "question": "设曲线 $y=x^2+x-2$ 在点 $P$ 处的切线的斜率等于 3，则 $P$ 点的坐标为 ____。",
              "solution": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "解析：由导数的几何意义可得"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "$k=y'=(x^2+x-2)'=2x+1$"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "由题意可得：$k=2x+1=3$"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "$\\therefore  x=1$，故 $\\therefore  y=0$，所以 $P$ 的坐标为 $(1,0)$。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": 4,
              "type": "fill_in",
              "answer": "$0$",
              "question": "设 $y=5x^3-6x^2+3x+2$，则 $y^{(4)}=\\underline{\\qquad}$。",
              "solution": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "解析：根据幂函数导数公式可得，$y^{(4)}=0$。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": 5,
              "type": "fill_in",
              "answer": "凹",
              "question": "若 $x\\in I$ 时，恒有 $f''(x)>0$，则 $y=f(x)$ 在 $I$ 内是____弧。",
              "solution": [
