              },
              "question": "设 $f'(x_0)=-2$，则在 $x=x_0$ 处，当 $\\Delta x\\to 0$ 时，$\\Delta y$ 与 $\\Delta x$ 相比较是（　）。",
              "solution": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "解析：$\\because  \\lim_{\\Delta x\\to 0}\\frac{\\Delta y}{\\Delta x}=f'(x_0)=-2$"
