              "answer": "B",
              "options": {
                "A": "连续，不可导",
                "B": "不连续，不可导",
                "C": "连续，可导",
                "D": "不连续，可导"
              },
              "question": "函数 $y=\\sin\\frac{1}{x}$ 在 $x=0$ 处（　）。",
              "solution": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "解析：一元函数连续与可导的关系：可导一定连续，连续不一定可导，也就是说不连续一定不可导。题目中，函数 $y=\\sin\\frac{1}{x}$ 在 $x=0$ 处无定义，间断，所以不连续，也就不可导。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": 11,
              "type": "single_choice",
              "answer": "B",
              "options": {
                "A": "$y''=2e^{2x-1}$",
                "B": "$y''=4e^{2x-1}$",
                "C": "$y''=2e^{2x}$",
                "D": "$y''=4e^{2x}$"
              },
              "question": "设 $y=e^{2x-1}$，则 $y''=$（　）。",
              "solution": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "解析："
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "$y'=(e^{2x-1})'=e^{2x-1}\\cdot (2x-1)'=2e^{2x-1}$"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "$y''=(2e^{2x-1})''=2e^{2x-1}\\cdot (2x-1)'=4e^{2x-1}$"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": 12,
              "type": "single_choice",
              "answer": "C",
              "options": {
